# Source and scripts must keep LF in the working tree.
# A shebang line followed by CRLF breaks vitest/esbuild's transform on Windows
# checkouts (plain `node` tolerates it), which made tests/integration/
# legacy-adoption.int.test.mjs fail locally while CI (Linux, LF) stayed green.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
